
========================================================================================
LRC(14) support-six Minkowski count: deleted anti-cosets
========================================================================================
  THM-538 means the Fourier tail is not a free product sum.
  It is a theta sum over Lambda(E), after deleting coordinate hyperplanes
  and all nonzero coefficient 7-cosets.  The count below is the first
  finite execution of that missing geometry-of-numbers object.

