========================================================================================
Session verdict
========================================================================================
  LRC(14) is still not proved in this run.
  The missing Minkowski count has been made concrete enough to split:
    (A) low-height anti-coset resonances, finite/additive-energy ledger;
    (B) dissociated deleted-coset theta tail, genuine successive minima;
    (C) no-scale clusters, collapse quotient rather than span decay.
